; The inline notice, in the stage card's own row rather than in a fourth row or a modal: a read that
; did not answer says what failed HERE, and the primary button beside it offers the retry. A row of
; its own would move everything under it the moment a read faulted.
[node name="NoticeLabel" type="Label" parent="Ui/Screen/Bands/Launch/Rows/StageCard/CardRow"]
