; ⚠️ ChromeButton for the same reason the settings control wears it, and one more: this 144 target
; has to fit INSIDE a 156-unit card. StageCard's own padding was 18 top and bottom, which left 120
; of interior for a control the touch-target rule pads to 144 — so the card grew to 180, the launch
; block to 486, and the hero band lost the 18 HomeLayout says it has. The card now pads by 6.
[node name="ChangeButton" type="Button" parent="Ui/Screen/Bands/Launch/Rows/StageCard/CardRow"]
