; The price, or the shortfall, or a placeholder holding the width while the read is still out. Drawn
; over the button as a child so the word stays centred whatever the badge says.
;
; ⚠️ Its own variation rather than HudCaption, because this is the one label on the screen whose
; background CHANGES UNDER IT: the button behind it is the action ember in state 1 and the energy
; sky in state 2. HudCaption's muted grey reads at about 1.7:1 on the ember and 1.1:1 on the sky —
; and on the sky the shortfall is the whole information the state carries. CostBadge is the
; button's own near-white with the theme's darkest ink drawn round it, which holds on both fills.
[node name="CostBadge" type="Label" parent="Ui/Screen/Bands/Launch/Rows/StartButton"]
